# ============================================================================
# NOFILL re-classification (found in testing): NOFILL rows conflated three classes.
# The fill mechanism reads only FILL rows, so behaviour is unchanged — but the
# semantics below bind future reviews and P2's acceptance gate:
#
# P2-PENDING — need is ORIG-ONLY: og draws the face under the authored per-face
#   admission field; native-original drops it because the fog-corner handoff
#   approximation disagrees. These are artifacts of OUR admission stand-in, not
#   level-data facts. P2 (authored admission port) must dissolve them:
#   acceptance metric = orig-need at these faces goes to ~0.
#     artisans s27 f3,f4 · blowhard s89 f0,f2,f7,f9,f22 · jacques s63 f1,f3 · s157 f15
#
# PHANTOM — candidates born only under the corrupted full-saturation og-sat
#   legs (pre-0x10000); they measure data=0 orig=0 today and drop out on the
#   next sweep regeneration:
#     dream_weavers s66 f3,f4,f7,f8 · s85 f3,f14 · blowhard s60 f5,f6,f13,f14
#     toasty s41 f0,f1 · ice_cavern s41 f16,f22 · doctor_shemp s84 f15 · stone_hill s33 f0
#
# All remaining NOFILL rows are DESIGN: data-backed LP-only sightlines where
# extended mode deliberately shows HP-true silhouettes (island-rim fringes,
# LP-alternate shapes).
# ============================================================================
